# The app deploys into a Linux container — a CRLF checkout (Windows autocrlf,
# including fresh deploy-worktrees) turned the entrypoint shebang into
# "bash\r" and crash-looped the Fly machine (2026-07-27, ~6min outage), and
# the same worktree build showed a retrieval anomaly that vanished on an
# LF main-tree build. Pin every text file to LF; binaries stay untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
docker-entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
*.npz -text
*.pdf -text
*.png -text
*.ttf -text
*.zip -text
